'''Islam''' is the fastest growing Religion at the moment. The followers of Islam are known as Muslims, i.e Those who submit to God. 

Islam can be translated into meaning on of two things:

-Submission
-Peace

In order to become part of the ummah (Muslim brotherhood) one must utter the shahada (declaration of faith)

'''Places of worship:''' Mosques

'''Holy book:''' Qur'an

